## The Layered Defense Model

Think of it as concentric security rings - an attack must bypass ALL layers to succeed.

```
User Input
    ↓
[Type Validation]      ← First gate: Is this the right kind of data?
    ↓
[Length Validation]    ← Second gate: Is this a reasonable amount of data?
    ↓
[Format Validation]    ← Third gate: Does this match the expected pattern?
    ↓
[Range Validation]     ← Fourth gate: Does this make business sense?
    ↓
Application Logic
```

